OL,3,AHegseth awards medal to war memorial
OL,4,Aguard who reprimanded him and group
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth has
OL,7,Fawarded a medal to the guard who
OL,8,Freprimanded his group at Arlington
OL,9,FNational Cemetery.
OL,11,FA video of a Veterans Day observance
OL,12,Fevent on Wednesday showed Hegseth, his
OL,13,Fwife, and senior advisers laughing and
OL,14,Ftalking while posing for photos in
OL,15,Ffront of the Tomb of the Unknown
OL,16,FSoldier before the guard told them to
OL,17,Fbe quiet.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
