OL,3,AHegseth awards medal to war memorial
OL,4,Aguard who reprimanded him and group
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the Pentagon later
OL,7,Fannounced that Hegseth had given
OL,8,FSpecialist Thomas Iglesias a Joint
OL,9,FService Commendation Medal "for the
OL,10,Fexecution of his duties at the Tomb of
OL,11,Fthe Unknown Soldier".
OL,13,FPhotos shared on the defence
OL,14,Fsecretary's X account showed him
OL,15,Fpresenting the medal to Iglesias.
